---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StravaFeed from '../components/StravaFeed.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Oskar Lindvall — Associate Director Development Quality at AstraZeneca, endurance runner and swimrunner, and father based in Gothenburg, Sweden."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <img class="photo" src="/images/about/oskar-portrait.jpg" alt="Oskar Lindvall" width="160" height="160" />

  <section>
    <h2>Professional bio</h2>
    <p>I lead quality systems and digital initiatives within CMC Development at AstraZeneca, supporting a large user base across Sweden and the UK. My background spans consulting, global line management, PMO leadership, and quality systems in a regulated pharmaceutical environment — with a consistent thread of translating between technical, commercial, and regulatory worlds. I studied Management and Economics of Innovation and Mechanical Engineering at Chalmers. More on how I lead in practice is in my <a href="/reflections/chatbot-ecosystem">reflection on AI adoption</a> and on the <a href="/thoughts#leadership">Thoughts</a> page.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Personal bio</h2>
    <p>Outside of work, I balance training, family life, and my professional career. I enjoy exercising — mostly running and swimruns. I train to stay healthy, but also to compete and push myself. I live with my wife and daughter, with our second daughter due soon. An interest in training and healthy habits is something my wife and I share. Our kids will do what you do, not what you say, which is why physical activity is a natural part of our lives. This site is where I collect the parts of me that don't fit neatly into a CV. More on training and family is on the <a href="/thoughts#exercise">Thoughts</a> page.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>More</h2>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="/about/cv">Professional CV</a></li>
      <li><a href="/about/athletics">Athletic results</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Links</h2>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/oskar-lindvall-35735854/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/46830295" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Strava</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/127870918-oskar-lindvall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Goodreads</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Strava activity</h2>
    <StravaFeed />
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .photo {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
